Changes made by Immunobiome Inc. relative to the upstream implementation
(Apache License 2.0, section 4b):

  * removed the WordPiece tokenizer and the sentence-pair / next-sentence
    machinery; IMBERT tokens are metabolic pathways, not word pieces
  * added a `model_bias` configuration flag so that every linear layer can be
    built without bias terms, which is how IMBERT v1.0 was trained
  * added the `attention_show_flg` / `run_pooler` / `encoder_result_layer`
    plumbing used by the fine-tuning heads
  * replaced the pre-training head with a pathway-level masked language model
  * logging, distributed-training and device-selection changes throughout

